tr na tej sliki ni našel kode QR ali črtne kode.","Liftr couldn't find a date column with exercises in this file.":"Liftr v tej datoteki ni našel stolpca z datumom in vajami.","Liftr couldn't find any exercises. Use lines like “Leg press 3x12 40 kg”.":"Liftr ni našel nobene vaje. Uporabi vrstice, kot je „Leg press 3x12 40 kg“.","Liftr export":"Izvoz iz Liftra","Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr nima računa, strežnika ali oglasov. Tvoji treningi, vaje, načrti, telesne mere in fitnes kartica so shranjeni v tvoji napravi in v tvojem zasebnem iCloudu.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr je narejen tako, da tvoj trening ostane zaseben.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr shranjuje treninge s trajanjem in kalorijami ter bere tvojo težo, sestavo telesa in srčni utrip v mirovanju. Dostop spremeniš v aplikaciji Zdravje → Profil → Aplikacije → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr pokaže tvoj zadnji trening, rekorde in kako napreduje tvoja moč.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr bo samodejno poskusil znova.","Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Liftr bo poskusil znova pozneje. Tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi.","Liftr uses it to greet you and puts it on the back of the badges you earn. You can change it later in Settings.":"Liftr ga uporablja za pozdrav in ga natisne na hrbtno stran pridobljenih značk. Kasneje ga lahko spremeniš v Nastavitvah.","Linked to {1}":"Povezano z {1}","Log weight":"Vnesi težo","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Beleži vaje, serije, ponovitve in težo v nekaj sekundah — brez zapiskov.","MIN":"MIN","