 “27 (3×10)” ali “25 / 18” v celicah. Deluje tudi datoteka z eno vrstico na serijo (datum, vaja, ponovitve, teža), prav tako izvoz iz aplikacije Liftr.","Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.":"Samo s tvojim dovoljenjem Liftr bere tvojo težo, telesno sestavo in srčni utrip v mirovanju ter shranjuje treninge, kalorije, razdaljo in težo. Zdravstveni podatki prek Liftr nikoli ne zapustijo tvojih naprav in se nikoli ne uporabljajo za oglaševanje. Dostop lahko kadar koli spremeniš v aplikaciji Zdravje.","Open Settings":"Odpri Nastavitve","Other file":"Druga datoteka","Paste":"Prilepi","Pause":"Premor","Point the camera at the code on your pass":"Usmeri kamero v kodo na svoji kartici","Pounds (lb)":"Funti (lb)","Previous workouts":"Prejšnji treningi","Privacy":"Zasebnost","Profile":"Profil","Progress":"Napredek","Questions?":"Vprašanja?","REPS":"PON.","REST":"POČITEK","Ready to train, {1}?":"Pripravljen na trening, {1}?","Ready to train?":"Gremo trenirat?","Records":"Rekordi","Reminders":"Opomniki","Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.":"Opomniki in časovnik počitka se načrtujejo v tvoji napravi. Strežnika za potisna obvestila ni.","Reminders are planned on this device. A day you already trained (also on Apple Watch or iPad) is skipped.":"Opomniki se načrtujejo v tej napravi. Dnevi, ko je trening že opravljen (tudi na Apple Watch ali iPadu), se preskočijo.","Remove exercise":"Odstrani vajo","Remove favourite":"Odstrani iz priljubljenih","Rename a column to link it to an exercise you already have.":"Preimenuj stolpec, da ga povežeš z vajo, ki jo že imaš.","Reps per set":"Ponovitev na serijo","Rest":"Počitek","Rest is over":"Počitek je končan","Rest time":"Čas počitka","Resting heart rate